#~ "document and it should be written to disk, a file dialog will be shown.</"
#~ "p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p><b>q/qa/wq/wqa : [escribir e] saír</b></p><p>Uso: <tt><b>[w]q[a]</b></"
