#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>You can split the Kate editor as many times as you like and\n"
#~ "in either direction. Each frame has its own status bar and\n"
#~ "can display any open document.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Just choose <br><strong>View -&gt; Split View -&gt; Split [ Horizontal "
#~ "| Vertical ]</strong></p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Pode dividir o editor Kate tantas veces como queira e\n"
#~ "en calquera dirección. Cada marco ten a súa propia barra de estado e\n"
#~ "pode mostrar calquera documento aberto.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Simplemente escolla <br><strong>Vista -&gt; Dividir a vista -&gt; "
#~ "Dividir en [ horizontal | vertical ]</strong></p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>You can move the Tool views to any side of the main window through "
